	(gr_text "Our Smuckie, who\nart in Rogers,\nhallowed be thy name.\nThy exam grades come,\nthy regrades be done,\non canvas as they\nare in\ngradescope.\nGive us this our daily\nlecture, and forgive\nour mistakes as we\nforgive your smuckie\nmoments. Lead us not\ninto ignorance but\ndeliver our\nGPAs from\nevil. For yours is\nthe power and the\nglory forever. ABen\n"
		(at 226.3 90.2 0)
		(layer "B.SilkS")
		(uuid "e80513c5-197d-4c3d-ba32-942fd34ca3ea")
		(effects
